
# <type>(<optional scope>): <short summary in the imperative>
#
# Types
# feat      New functionality
# fix       Correctness or robustness fix
# perf      Latency, allocation, or throughput improvement
# refactor  Internal restructuring without changing behavior
# test      Tests and fixtures
# build     Dependencies, toolchain, or build configuration
# ci        Continuous integration changes
# docs      Documentation changes
# style     Formatting-only changes
# chore     Maintenance outside the categories above
# revert    Revert an earlier change
#
# Examples
# feat(locals): add an array viewer
# fix(debugger): retain cancelled in-flight requests
# perf(source): avoid copying unchanged source buffers
#
# Omit the scope for changes spanning several subsystems.
# Use ! before the colon for breaking changes and explain them in a
# BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
#
# After a blank line, explain why the change is needed and note meaningful
# verification. Keep unrelated changes in separate commits.
